        "created_at": "2015-02-17T17:34:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In the game I believe if that turn you have a power phase you get the extra power then, if not you get it immediately, so I would agree, you don't get it if your turn ends.</p><p>I know that \"immediately end your turn\" sends you directly to the End of turn phase, but it makes sense to me that when Prayer of Desperation is resolved and goes to the trash your turn is over, otherwise your turn wasn't ended.</p>",
