        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Foote\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/48/1877_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Foote:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>phantaskippy wrote:</b><br><blockquote>That is how they are using those cards in the app. &nbsp;If Smite the Transgressor is played out of turn you must use the power immediately, if played on your turn you must use it during your power phase.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nYeah thats how I would play it\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That is not how the App is doing it though. If Smite the Transgressor is played on your turn, you immediately use a power.</p>",
