        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"xThe Killswitch\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n xThe Killswitch:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Considering her power phase is immediately after her play phase, that would make sense…or is there a case in which during her turn she had an alternative?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Pillars of Hercules allows her to play an additonal card during her play phase. This allows you to play Smite the Transgressor to use a power, then after using said power you may play another card. Therefore, no matter what turn you play Smite the Trangressor, you use the power immediately and not during your power phase.</p>",
