        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"xThe Killswitch\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n xThe Killswitch:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>but she should be able to use her second play first.Confirmation, Migrant?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Why? You don't play 2 cards before you start resolving the first cards effects.</p>",
